2DA V1.0
*
# ethren (M3.2): the names areas go by in the funnel's graveyard ("Gristle, cordwainer: crossbow bolt, the
# wooded trail"), by area resref; _ for spaces. The engine writes the name into a peasant's funnel record
# when it dies (DCC::Funnel::place); an area without a row goes by its world map caption, else its resref.
# Ethren's own areas come with Phase 4; the test games ship their own copy.
# FLOOR (traps and thief skills): the floor DC of sneak silently in the area (5 cushioned, 10 stone, 15
# creaky wood, 20 very noisy; * or no row: 10); dccfloor.2da's regions set their own.
           NAME  FLOOR
